        <mxCell id="c124" value="&lt;b&gt;calc&lt;/b&gt; expressions and &lt;b&gt;script&lt;/b&gt; steps compile with the profile (limits: script ≤ 64 KiB, call depth 16, ...). A compile error is a profile error, so a broken step never reaches ingest; at run time a calc that cannot evaluate leaves the record unchanged." style="fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DIBM%2BPlex%2BSans%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C400%3B0%2C700%3B1%2C400%26display%3Dblock;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="140" width="420" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c125" value="&lt;b&gt;Pipeline&lt;/b&gt; = [[pipeline]] steps in profile order. Disabled steps stay as no-op placeholders so step indexes and StepStats line up with the profile; a plugin step needs an installed transform id." style="fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss2%3Ffamily%3DIBM%2BPlex%2BSans%3Aital%2Cwght%400%2C400%3B0%2C700%3B1%2C400%26display%3Dblock;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;shape=note;size=12;strokeWidth=1;strokeColor=#8A93A6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2130;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="140" width="420" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
